      "content": "Please remember that your struggles are not the child's fault, and their safety depends on you caring for your own well-being to keep them protected. Staying out of the fire you are in is not abandoning them; it is a painful way to save yourself from becoming truly broken before you can be the parent you want to be. A trusted therapist can help you untangle this math so that the love you feel is not weighed down by what you think you cannot handle. Please seek a professional counselor to help you carry this heavy load for you now, rather than letting your exhaustion define your life for them.",
