      "content": "it just feels so selfish to keep dragging them through this. like, if i'm just a source of stress and lack, why should they have to endure it? sometimes i think the most selfless thing a person can do is realize they aren't helping and just... step out of the way. to let them have a clean slate without my mistakes hanging over them.",
